This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

It is a mutation battery behind a shipped fixture: the battery behind `self-update-fixture-log`.
It edits copies of the distribution's own `core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/self-update-fixtures.sh`,
which a consumer is denied editing, and its runtime is why the arms and the mutants are separate
directories. It sources `self-update-fixture-log/lib.sh`, so it drives every mutant through the
worlds and log readers the shipped arms use.
